ggests ability to handle pressure, and his concern for others and attention skills are critical. So we keep vote for A, but note need for more stress evidence.\n\nThus public message: I agree with Agent 2's recommendation for Candidate A, but I want to highlight that we lack direct evidence of stress resilience for A, while B has explicit stress handling. However A's quick decision making and attention may compensate. I still recommend A, but we should seek more info on stress resilience.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 2's point and Agent 1's answer. Provide evidence: quick decisions, attention, concern for others; lack of stress evidence; B's stress handling.\n\nThus produce public message and metadata vote for Candidate A."}
